# The listen address comes from scripts/testhost (-o ListenAddress=...).
PasswordAuthentication yes
KbdInteractiveAuthentication yes
# A disposable box: root may log in (same per-run password) to install things. setuid
# binaries (sudo, su) do not elevate in this rootless setup yet.
PermitRootLogin yes
AllowUsers tester root
PrintMotd yes
Banner none
